RASSP publications - the single source for the Publications page.

Radar, sonar and electronic warfare publications of the group since 2022, collected from the
ORCID and Google Scholar profiles of the researchers (metadata from Crossref and arXiv).
To add a paper, paste its BibTeX entry below, then regenerate the pages from the repository root:

    pip install pybtex
    python markdown_generator/pubsFromBib.py

Useful fields: author, title, journal or booktitle, year, month, doi, url, abstract.
Entry type "article" goes under Journal Articles, "inproceedings" under Conference Papers,
anything else under Preprints. Override with a field like: category = {journal}

(BibTeX ignores text outside entries, so these notes are safe. Do not use the at-sign here.)

